cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GeoTile Label
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
version: 1.4.0
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later

abstract: >-
  GeoTile Label is a Windows desktop application for annotating satellite and airborne
  imagery and building versioned machine-learning datasets. It handles electro-optical
  and synthetic-aperture-radar scenes, georeferenced and non-georeferenced products,
  axis-aligned and oriented bounding boxes. Full source scenes, their metadata and the
  annotations remain the canonical record; tiles, splits and the YOLO, COCO and Pascal
  VOC exports are derived products that can be regenerated with different settings.

keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - satellite imagery
  - synthetic aperture radar
  - image annotation
  - object detection
  - oriented bounding box
  - machine learning dataset
  - geospatial
  - YOLO
  - desktop application

